  <Localize id="1c35ba90-f377-4740-8d67-7e0f7846cf98" localized="-1494134289">这根木杆代表尼福尔海姆，冰雪与寒冷的故乡</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="5f254b34-a264-460c-81dc-ad385ce115a6" localized="-1494134289">这根木杆代表尼福尔海姆，冰雪与寒冷的故乡</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="15581495-1376-48fe-a73b-ad744635cbb5" localized="-1494134289">这根木杆代表尼福尔海姆，冰雪与寒冷的故乡</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="3ce4f1e0-5a8b-48b1-8034-c81d5f4bc014" localized="-1097183424">哈尔夫丹的氏族一向与你们交好。他们的许多交易都沿着流经你们家园的那条河逆流而上。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="2314f159-bd08-433c-9377-d1f61dffd0c3" localized="1073959646">你现在还不能离开，还有要紧事要处理。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="87392b7e-5264-46ae-a648-15ee9f4feab3" localized="1293745518">滚开，你们这些肮脏的瘟狗！要我一个人守这座桥，我也奉陪到底！</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="28322048-ca1a-4d12-8072-2aa19b651540" localized="1073959646">你现在还不能离开，还有要紧事要处理。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="6d2722e2-b78a-40ed-8ab7-cb2149369938" localized="1875753234">墓地</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="1da52ec2-d30c-4680-a970-accba27167ce" localized="1965085675">碎颅者斯库勒那面略显阴森的旗帜，宣告耶灵的人出席了葬礼。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="d0bd5398-f3b8-4d16-8e50-931561e09548" localized="24879565">内夫娅的家</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="658d263c-b103-42e2-8bfc-8177274a33a6" localized="-311945638">女巫的小屋</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="a2e82412-82d8-4e6c-ace6-a530863df520" localized="-1809655204">一块未完工的符文石碑，只刻出了几道用来容纳文字的凹槽。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="b59b7715-9646-4137-b4a0-6f2f2f072dd2" localized="768538271">你还记得父亲把霍尔蒙的遗体带回家的那天。此后将近一年，内夫娅都不被允许和你一起训练（但她还是偷偷来了）。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="300e1630-82de-45a5-94fe-0d2a98b17335" localized="-61004055">这块石碑是你祖父立的。卢恩符文写道：“埃金斯基亚尔迪立此碑，以纪念斯凯恩的优雅斯万维特。”</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="a9363219-66ac-4b9b-974f-69036723962a" localized="2140261892">长屋</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="9e2892fd-6eff-4764-98ee-bbc64647aba5" localized="-1793122231">里伯的旗帜，立起来宣告雅尔·拉格恩希尔德的到来。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="27504ead-2758-4932-92ea-85595dc9bd7c" localized="642729065">埃迪丝的农场</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="25d13f34-2355-4c15-9dbc-b332e251ff37" localized="373761924">铁匠</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="adff7653-b9be-4786-bb17-4c45effaf715" localized="-1322285230">你现在不能进入这栋建筑。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="113e3b82-be65-4088-867e-80f916c03d73" localized="171863478">训练场</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="a6a6899a-412d-4cf0-9f72-1dbdfe716e4e" localized="1254649264">疾病夺走阿尔瓦尔德已有十年，埃迪丝仍在他坟前点着蜡烛。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="a20acdb6-78bc-4a24-810c-8da1d4b805b4" localized="1073959646">你现在还不能离开，还有要紧事要处理。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="ca7a5a35-3b71-43c5-a0fe-6f28569cbb7e" localized="-934478492">凯蒂尔的家</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="8ee07e91-21b7-4a1b-8f2c-e57317b476e6" localized="1294275312">布拉娜的摊位</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="5f49209d-866a-4cdf-a5f1-88b684bf9449" localized="1645683338">你氏族的旗帜在凛冽的冬日寒风中轻轻飘动。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="4913c1f7-b1bc-4632-b570-5f51dbc140d3" localized="496133696">弗朗格尔的摊位</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="4c04b0f4-5712-4845-a40b-a6f27319b2ab" localized="-902826179">猎人利奥特和西格丽德住在这里，这样能靠近森林。凯蒂尔在里屋有张床。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="27ce0a5a-ee57-4f81-acd9-2c55c45a1d01" localized="-1546901631">这座小农场属于埃迪丝，她是阿尔瓦尔德的遗孀，和两个儿子住在这里。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="64da6fee-b97c-40f8-8c94-3933201b8d95" localized="916202891">内夫娅和她的母亲比约格迪丝以及她的双胞胎姐妹埃芙拉住在这里。这个时辰去打扰她们可不礼貌。</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="96426e0f-6d96-4c6c-aae9-9e3d5e2f3bf4" localized="-1786924655">宴席的剩菜还在壁炉上欢快地咕嘟冒泡。这锅炖菜只要保存得当，能吃上好几个月。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="645dcee6-ded4-4f83-a488-a0b3bc5e9f06" localized="-192053007">你父亲打造的第一把剑。算不上什么好武器，但作为初次尝试倒也不差。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="96d2c65e-bda7-4371-b372-b623fc89dea9" localized="1438329577">三天后……</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="659dfe04-0f29-4406-8129-5a887cdcb001" localized="851901015">一锅兔肉炖菜在火坑上咕嘟作响，诱人的香味弥漫了整间长屋。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="5829e507-3283-49e7-9310-ccd8147e28a7" localized="-1210054459">奥丁，请助我一臂之力\n将往昔岁月的挣扎\n凝作玻璃上闪烁的光</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="72900a9f-385c-4a86-94f7-3b019b369cdd" localized="1217824347">武器架</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="75e0bb72-ee88-40a9-a75e-766cad5ec712" localized="653991157">到外面去，直面埃尔林·托尔吉斯尔松的儿子们。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="8c32267b-d638-40ee-8fd4-8c4ea240f449" localized="-192053007">你父亲打造的第一把剑。算不上什么好武器，但作为初次尝试倒也不差。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="d4445c16-344b-4406-a112-21c97a0cd809" localized="462592344">你现在还不该离开。</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="207e18e5-80ac-45bd-b603-efc8d7a74a61" localized="164085117">比约格迪丝被视为镇上最好的织工——这台织布机为半个氏族提供了衣裳。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="8d39509a-d44c-431a-815d-b9b4de2ec8a2" localized="509764757">内夫娅和埃芙拉同睡一张床。内夫娅的一堆装备藏在床架下，像个见不得人的秘密。</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="851449f1-ae5c-431a-98c5-95fcf2b6dff9" localized="1485015223">作为猎人的饭食，这锅炖菜无论卖相还是气味都出奇地叫人没胃口。显然好肉都卖给别人了。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="58d3b351-e1eb-487a-8e49-c86dc74101ab" localized="-1754913461">西格丽德和利奥特需要些私人时间时，凯蒂尔有时会睡在你的长屋里。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="1c044fa8-8f5d-4a20-b8ba-1b05a403f720" localized="1782002913">这木桶内壁仍覆着一层来自外面窑炉的松焦油。利奥特熬制焦油，卖给邻近的村庄。</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="6941915d-1ea6-4ae2-a4a7-368c1c277a90" localized="1115592432">自从埃尔林一家搬进新居，他们家的老农舍就被彻底荒废了。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="89a0db70-74a6-4401-bc0b-e3e0e0dae4ed" localized="1029607774">这看起来像一座小坟，差不多有成年狗那么大。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="5eb507ab-f892-4aea-a60d-8bca675a5c94" localized="897368202">农舍</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="be8efe39-ee48-406a-8d2b-01fe7fc580fa" localized="-34143536">那名旅人把他的兄弟埃吉尔葬在了这里。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="83ce3c2d-bc78-45c5-8815-acb83372662e" localized="1656602056">格里穆尔夫一直忙着为过冬收集木材。还剩下一批像样的储备。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="0e72f15b-f6cf-49d5-93af-1e46accf9b6f" localized="1429585243">格里穆尔夫叔叔的屋子</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="7c2997df-8c9b-4c4c-8ffb-31531b83c1af" localized="-1538907289">遗骸</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="6b2bac22-fb77-4277-8ee7-5456fa525cba" localized="1051731886">旅人营地</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="24c05b36-1369-4319-be51-1b9492e395e1" localized="-263036547">一具遗骸半埋在雪里，左手已经散落，却仍朝插在地里的锈剑抓去，骨节分明的手指散落在剑柄周围。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="f3b7b728-5d89-4af0-9583-a8372ddeffb3" localized="-82205296">旧壁炉，看样子已经很久没用过了。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="4a22999d-3a28-44cd-b11e-f5bfc30bf814" localized="-441726975">我们不会回去的！你永远别想让我们回去！</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="48c3a704-2797-4b75-98f4-0eff060b588b" localized="1997803970">树枝</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="c4a462b0-51ea-4556-a7e6-7d6836204677" localized="1761735288">你记得阿尔夫迪丝阿姨是个优雅美丽的女人。格里穆尔夫叔叔似乎一直没能真正从失去她的打击中走出来。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="668bb7fa-3f56-4071-af98-e7e98745ebd2" localized="-1575290430">一头鹿，死在腾跃的半途，已被时间腐蚀得残缺散乱</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="757a7dfd-7096-4647-a34e-776433226734" localized="259594523">第二天，正午</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="7e3506e9-e538-4d7f-97d3-1d865d6d3c2c" localized="1150041005">巨魔树</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="15013617-e8b3-4a43-915a-0175610001fd" localized="-700512633">小屋</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="d7aa20ad-ebb9-47a2-8e5b-d6aa29b4d700" localized="854951573">林间空地</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="c78ab708-7be7-41bf-88d2-e3369b1a73d4" localized="-1243965407">渔夫的小屋</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="932293a8-8e5b-44c8-aa6f-ff5db9a4f2da" localized="-1007906460">把巨魔树的树皮带回里伯交给女祭司。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="8f61b521-0bbf-4a69-972d-c3055232a8d4" localized="352062562">回到比约格迪丝身边，把坏消息告诉她。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="47a3b984-ad81-46ce-a0da-997365066491" localized="1039958188">回到雅尔·拉格恩希尔德身边，告诉她沼泽已经安全了。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="7f1ea475-800b-4c79-9df8-b7a720a31efe" localized="863030215">一具年轻女子的尸体，穿着奴隶的衣服。她似乎是顺着溪流漂下来的，一直漂到了这里。</Localize>
  


  <Localize id="46e118cb-6df4-4c1c-922c-d2805cb6718e" localized="229887193">你！你看着有点眼熟。我要和你聊两句。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="ed5cfb87-b685-4f95-bb53-e1ced40d0793" localized="2402347">就现在！</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="137c0a47-dfe3-46f1-bdc7-317c3d71e88b" localized="1382835019">门锁得很严实。门后飘来一股明显的硫磺味。</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="e30311e9-2a55-4d9d-8a83-2f44c6d3bb1d" localized="-1276033500">雅尔·拉格恩希尔德的长屋</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="d743b1b8-38d6-4778-8670-f5f2a182330d" localized="1045238863">破败的家园</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="17faac79-e421-4c1d-86cd-e94f43131057" localized="571143738">药品摊</Localize>
  

  <Localize id="aac3532a-8018-4cf5-84dc-5065a621c06e" localized="-560237864">英吉马尔的家</Localize>
  

